<title>USA: Milwaukee Land plans to acquire PG Design.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee Land plans to acquire PG Design.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milwaukee Land Co said on Friday it signed a letter of intent to acquire  PG Design Electronics.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to due diligence, negotiation of a final contract and shareholder approval.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>PG Design is a contract and product design manufacturer of printed circuit boards for the computer industry. It had sales in fiscal 1996 of about $23 million and forecasts sales of about $30 million for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>Milwaukee Land is a closed-end investment company.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
